1259 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I\220m Kit\054 a game designer that specialises in UI\057UX\n\nThe interface is the voice of the developer and if it is not clear then it is not heard\054 so I create this clarity with iterations based on the feedback of others as my perspective is not all seeing and not without its blind spots\056\n\nBesides designing games\073 I\220m an avid tabletop fan whether that\220s wargaming or role playing games\054 I also partake in a few outdoor hobbies such as hiking to try and mitigate all of the time my face is pressed against a screen\056)
     /K [ 12 ]
     /P 1260 0 R
